Frequently Asked Questions
Got Questions? We Have Answers.
How should I store my Be Strong Nuts & Honey jar?
Store your jar at room temperature away from direct sunlight. Raw organic honey does not require refrigeration. Natural crystallization may occur over time; simply place the jar in warm water to restore its liquid texture.
Are there any added sugars or syrup additives?
Absolutely zero added cane sugar, corn syrup, or artificial additives. We use 100% pure raw wildflower honey sourced directly from artisanal bee farms.
How long is the shelf life?
Because raw honey is a natural preservative, our mixed nuts remain fresh, crunchy, and delicious for up to 12 months from the batch preparation date.
What are the shipping delivery times?
We ship orders within 24 hours. Standard domestic delivery takes 2 to 4 business days. Free express shipping is automatically applied to orders over $50!
